Map:mapbuckleburyferry/Desc
"Bucklebury Ferry was a raft-ferry used as the second main crossing point of the Brandywine River from the Shire to Buckland. \nCreeps: 2x Trolls , 4x Wargs , 2x Goblins\nNeutral Structures: 2x Inn"
